  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组为</span> </span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">非官方</span> <span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">移植版</span>，基于原版 Forge 模组 <a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"This Mod is ported based on the original Forge mod RusticDelight Delight and this work is licensed under the MIT License.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rustic Delight</a>。本作品遵循</span> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>MIT 许可证</strong></span>。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>原版模组的许可证如下：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rustic-delight#license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT&nbsp;</a>。</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>该许可证允许我将其移植到 Fabric 平台。<br></strong><span style=\"color:#169179\">本模组需要 <a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight Refabricated</a> 才能运行。</span><strong><br><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4e278488-9732-420e-a192-d0bbb673c4c4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"114\" height=\"114\"><br></strong></span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">功能特性</span></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">新增作物： <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">棉花&nbsp;</span> 和 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">甜椒。 <span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">棉花可在森林中找到 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">，而 <span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">甜椒则分布在丛林中。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">新增食物。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">新增方块。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>如果在移植过程中遇到任何问题，请直接在 Discord 或 GitHub 上联系我：</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9wwUjCpC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112816/description_fa800ee4-5aac-4470-b457-61c102f028a8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"102\"></a><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4;text-decoration:underline\">最后，特别感谢 <a style=\"color:#c2e0f4;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/phantomwing\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>PhantomWing</span></a> 制作了这款优秀的模组！</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>",
